S_N1 76.2 3.3 4.14 7 0
S_N2 76.2 3.3 4.14 7 0
S_N3 76.2 3.3 4.14 7 0
S_N4 76.2 3.3 4.14 7 0
S_B0 76.2 3.3 4.14 7 0

[JUNCTIONS]
